            <details><summary>How does POSONLY connect inventory and point of sale?<span>+</span></summary><p>POSONLY keeps product stock and POS sales in the same company workspace. Completing a sale deducts its items from the selected store’s stock. Stock receipts, transfers, adjustments, and restocked returns are recorded in your stock movement history. <a href="{{ route('marketing.inventory', [], false) }}">See how inventory management works.</a></p></details>
            <details><summary>How much does POSONLY cost in the Philippines?<span>+</span></summary><p>Monthly plans are @foreach($plans as $plan){{ $plan['name'] }} at ₱{{ number_format($plan['monthly_cents'] / 100) }}{{ $loop->last ? '.' : ($loop->remaining === 1 ? ', and ' : ', ') }}@endforeach Start with a free {{ config('billing.trial_days') }}-day trial, with no card required. Yearly plans save 20% compared with 12 monthly payments; the full yearly amount is paid together. <a href="#pricing">Compare prices and team limits.</a></p></details>
            <details><summary>Can I try the POS before creating a workspace?<span>+</span></summary><p>@if($companySignedIn)Yes. Try the interactive POS preview on this page using sample products. Your workspace and stock stay separate; use Back to workspace when you are ready to continue.@elseif($workspaceDemoEnabled)Yes. The live demo includes a sample store, products, locations, and sales. You can make sample sales, adjust stock, and explore reports without creating an account.@else Yes. Try the interactive POS preview on this page without an account. To track your own stock and explore reports, start a free workspace trial.@endif <a href="#demo">Try the sample checkout.</a></p></details>
            <details><summary>What POS equipment and internet connection do I need?<span>+</span></summary><p>Use a computer or tablet with a browser and an internet connection. POSONLY requires an online connection; offline checkout is not available. Keyboard-mode barcode scanners work with product search, and receipts use your browser’s print dialog. Card readers and cash drawers require their own vendor setup. <a href="{{ route('marketing.pos', [], false) }}">Check the POS setup and workflow.</a></p></details>
            <details><summary>Can I print receipts with my own company details?<span>+</span></summary><p>Yes. Administrators can save a company logo, address, and contact number in Settings. Those details appear on the receipt preview and browser-printed receipt. The printed receipt is a POS sale record; BIR accreditation is not included.</p></details>
            <details><summary>Can cashiers see my business reports?<span>+</span></summary><p>Cashiers can process sales and tag customers. Managers can manage inventory and view reporting. Administrators can also manage the team and company settings. Permissions are checked by the server, and each company has its own workspace.</p></details>
            <details><summary>Does POSONLY connect to an online store or marketplace?<span>+</span></summary><p>All store locations inside your POSONLY company share stock records. Live external e-commerce and marketplace connectors are not available yet. Multi-channel workflows can currently be tested with local simulated integrations; they do not connect to a real online store or take external payments.</p></details>
            <details><summary>Can POSONLY process card or wallet payments at my counter?<span>+</span></summary><p>For POS sales, POSONLY records cash, card, and wallet tenders, including split payments. Collect card or wallet payments on your existing terminal or payment app before recording them in POSONLY. Subscription checkout is separate from your customer sales.</p></details>
